<title>USA: Convertible Holdings sets qtly div $0.33.</title>
<headline>Convertible Holdings sets qtly div $0.33.</headline>
<dateline>PLAINBORO, N.J. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Convertible Holdings Inc, a close-end mutual fund, said Tuesday its quarterly ordinary income dividend of $0.33 is payable July 24 to shareholders of record July 17.</p>
<p>The previous income dividend of $0.29 was payable April 30.</p>
</text>
